eed to consider that  this was worked on on unselected  patients that received  pd1 or pdl1 monotherapy  and we are kind of giving these drugs  less frequently in unselected patients  but apart from that i think that this  kind of demonstrates  or or or suggests that it is important  to measure markers from  a specific compartments  and the dsp workflow is relatively  simple and it uses ffpe  tissue samples and perhaps although it's  a bit early  to talk about this right now but with  further validation this is an assay or a  platform that could  eventually make it into the clinic if  these findings  are confirmed in independent cohorts and  larger codes  so just to give a brief summary of this  uh work and  my take-home message would be that  in this work we show the potential of  the geomix dsp  platform to to discover  biomarkers of response in a novel way  and these novel ways related to this  compartment specific  measurement of biomarkers of response  and this illustrates the potential of  the technology and these findings will  need to be validated in  independent cohorts but i think it's a  very good start  these are some of them are novel  and interesting findings that we will  actually try to validate  in a future cohorts thank you very much  thank you again dr the godzilla for your  presentation  and discussion


